{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19215","headline":"谢窦员外旬休早凉见示诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"谢窦员外旬休早凉见示诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新秋十日澣朱衣，铃阁无声公吏归。\n风韵渐高梧叶动，露光初重槿花稀。\n四时苒苒催容鬓，三爵油油忘是非。\n更报明朝池上酌，人知太守字玄晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}